<main class="container mt-5 mb-5">
  <div class="row">
    <div class="offset-md-1 col-md-10">

      <h1><%= title %></h1>

      <p>
        Here are some projects I have worked on during my Networking and IT Security studies.
      </p>

      <h2>1. Network Design - Cisco Packet Tracer</h2>

      <p>
        For this project, I designed and configured a network connecting multiple buildings using Cisco Packet Tracer. I created an IP addressing scheme, configured routers and switches, and established communication between different networks.
      </p>

      <p>
        I tested the network using ping commands to verify connectivity between devices and troubleshoot configuration issues.
      </p>

      <p>
        <strong>Technologies:</strong>
        Cisco Packet Tracer, IPv4 Addressing, Subnetting, Routing, Switching
      </p>

      <hr>

      <h2>2. Cloud Infrastructure - AWS Deployment</h2>

      <p>
        For this project, I worked with Amazon Web Services to create and manage cloud infrastructure using AWS CloudFormation and Terraform.
      </p>

      <p>
        I deployed EC2 instances, configured cloud resources, and used infrastructure-as-code tools to automate the creation of cloud environments.
      </p>

      <p>
        <strong>Technologies:</strong>
        AWS, EC2, CloudFormation, Terraform, Linux
      </p>

      <hr>

      <h2>3. Web Development - Personal Website</h2>

      <p>
        For this project, I developed an interactive personal website using HTML, CSS, and JavaScript. The website included multiple pages and interactive features such as a memory quiz and photo gallery.
      </p>

      <p>
        I also worked with Firebase to store and manage website information.
      </p>

      <p>
        <strong>Technologies:</strong>
        HTML, CSS, JavaScript, Firebase
      </p>

    </div>
  </div>
</main>

